{"articleNo":"82987","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=82987&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"Design Studio(가칭) 명칭 공모","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2013.05.10","hit":"4819","attachments":[{"name":"Design Studio(가칭) 명칭 공모 신청서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=82987&attachNo=71505"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 18pt\">Design Studio(가칭) 명칭 공모</span></strong></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><strong></strong>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;○ <!--StartFragment--><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">융합형 창의설계를 위한 활동 공간 제공을 목표로 하며, 학생들이 자유롭게 토론하고 설계할 수 있는 교류 공간 및 대학 내에서 다감각적 경험(multi-sensorial experience)을 위한 체험 공간 목적으로 완공된 Design Studio(가칭_그린에너지관 108호) 명칭 공모사업을 아래와 같이 실시하고자 하오니 학생들의 많은 참여 부탁드립니다.</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\"><img style=\"WIDTH: 279px; HEIGHT: 342px\" alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.kumoh.ac.kr/upload/0609dc31-86ce-43e4-8f7d-970f67b5dcb7.bmp\" width=\"210\" height=\"342\"><img style=\"WIDTH: 257px; HEIGHT: 345px\" alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.kumoh.ac.kr/upload/e0d6d1ba-858a-4559-83d7-6003325db48c.bmp\" width=\"331\" height=\"345\"></span></span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\"><p class=\"바탕글\"><!--?xml:namespace prefix = v ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" /--><v:shape style=\"WIDTH: 351.47pt; HEIGHT: 277.21pt; v-text-anchor: top\" id=\"_x102918112\" type=\"#_x0000_t75\"><!--?xml:namespace prefix = w ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word\" /--><w:wrap type=\"square\"></w:wrap></v:shape>&nbsp;</p></span></span><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">&nbsp;<strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">가. 공모대</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">상 : 본교 재학생 및 휴학생</span></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;▶ &nbsp;공모 신청서 중 우수작 3건을 선정하고 우수작에 대해 시상금 지급</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;▶&nbsp;&nbsp;우수작 중 선정된 최우수작은 Design Studio(가칭) 명칭으로 제공</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><strong></strong>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">나</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">. 공모주제 : 창의적이고 미래지향적인 우리대학의 비전을 직/간접적으로 표현</span></strong></p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"><!--StartFragment--><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-TOP: 11.4pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">다. </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">공모 내용</span></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;▶ Design Studio</span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">(가칭)</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">의 명칭 : 1인당 3개 이내</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;▶ 명칭을 제안하게 된 배경 및 설명 : 200자 이내</span></span></span></span> </p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 0.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"><strong></strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 0.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 0.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 0.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 0.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 0.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 0.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"><strong>라. 공모기간 : 2013. 05. 13(월) ~ 2013. 05. 21(화)까지</strong></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"><strong>마. 선정발표(예정) : 2013. 05. 31(금)</strong></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><strong></strong>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">바. 제출방법 : 신청서 작성 후 담당자 이메일(</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">sks525@kumoh.ac.kr</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\